\ lib/doc.1z - Documentation tooling: load extraction, rendering, and reporting.
\
\ Convenience aggregator over the doc/ submodules.
\
\ Note: `reexport` currently drops a reexported word's transitively-imported dependencies,
\       so `extract-doc-info-from-file` (which in turn calls `1z-tokenize`) raises
\       `unknown-word` when reached through this aggregator. Alternatively, import
\       `doc/extract` directly for that word.

"doc/extract" load reexport
"doc/render" load reexport
"doc/report" load reexport
